      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/9/e9fca588ff03154a68a0c60ca71a686f3c59de52.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e9fca588ff03154a68a0c60ca71a686f3c59de52\" title=\"image_2025-08-25_212009838\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/9/e9fca588ff03154a68a0c60ca71a686f3c59de52_2_632x500.png\" alt=\"image_2025-08-25_212009838\" data-base62-sha1=\"xnWxHetND77cHkTqUDpScNheIpk\" width=\"632\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/9/e9fca588ff03154a68a0c60ca71a686f3c59de52_2_632x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/9/e9fca588ff03154a68a0c60ca71a686f3c59de52_2_948x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/9/e9fca588ff03154a68a0c60ca71a686f3c59de52_2_1264x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"6E6E6E\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image_2025-08-25_212009838</span><span class=\"informations\">2403×1899 194 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Sorry for such a noob question, but I didnt find an answer in other posts.</p>\n<p>What is the name of this doctype? I cannot find it in the list of doctypes, and secondly,</p>\n<p>How do I remove the default filter from this field?</p>\n<p>Thank you</p>",
