      "id": 478871,
      "username": "Sudhanshu",
      "name": "Sudhanshu Badole",
      "created_at": "2025-08-25T15:12:51.874Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/jamesaus\">@jamesaus</a><br>\nFrom the screenshot, this dialog <strong>“Select Items to Manufacture”</strong> is part of the <strong>“Work Order” creation flow</strong> in <strong>ERPNext’s Manufacturing module</strong> when you’re trying to manufacture items from a <strong>Sales Order</strong>.</p>\n<p>This dialog is <strong>not a separate doctype</strong>.<br>\nIt’s a <strong>custom dialog created via JavaScript</strong> when you click <strong>“Create &gt; Work Order”</strong> in the Sales Order form.</p>",
